    <string name="permissions_dialog_message">Current status:

All files access: %1$s
Notifications: %2$s
Battery optimization exception: %3$s
Overlay protection: %4$s

Used permissions:
• All files access — reads user-selected firmware, ZIP/APK and diagnostic files from /sdcard/Download/NekoFlash.
• Notifications — shows a foreground operation notification.
• Wake lock — keeps CPU awake only during flashing or sideload and is released after the operation.
• Hide overlay windows — on Android 12+ blocks other apps from drawing over this app during sensitive actions.
• Internet/network state — used only by the Mi Account / Mi Unlock flow to communicate with official Xiaomi HTTPS endpoints.

Not requested:
• Draw over other apps / SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW.
• Contacts, SMS, microphone, camera, phone, or location.</string>
